SYMPTOMS & REACTIONS
Is this a side effect? Will there be hair loss, sickness, tiredness — is this normal?
Contact your care team
This is a question for the care team, and ChemoWell will not try to answer it. The app keeps a record of what happened and when. It holds no information about any drug, has no idea what is normal for this person's treatment, and would be guessing if it said otherwise.
STEP BY STEP
1
Write the question down, along with what you have actually seen and when it started.
2
Ask the care team, or the pharmacist who dispensed the medication — they have the person's actual treatment plan in front of them.
3
Anything sudden, severe, or frightening is a phone call now, not a question for later.
4
Log the symptom here with a note in your own words. Turning up to an appointment with dates and times is worth far more than trying to remember.
WORTH KNOWING
ChemoWell is a record-keeping tool, not a source of medical information. Never delay care because of anything shown in this app.
